<h2 class="art-postheader">
<a href="http://www.albrindisi.com/weight-loss/the-secret-of-kate-middleton%e2%80%99s-body-shape/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to The Secret of Kate Middleton’s Body Shape">
The Secret of Kate Middleton’s Body Shape</a>
</h2>
<div class="art-postheadericons art-metadata-icons">
<img class="art-metadata-icon" src="http://www.albrindisi.com/wp-content/themes/Take_Relax/images/postdateicon.png" width="17" height="18" alt="" />
July 10th, 2011 | <img class="art-metadata-icon" src="http://www.albrindisi.com/wp-content/themes/Take_Relax/images/postauthoricon.png" width="18" height="18" alt="" />
Author: <a href="http://www.albrindisi.com/author/admin/" title="Posts by admin" rel="author">admin</a>
</div>
<div class="art-postcontent">
    <!-- article-content -->

          <p><a href="http://www.albrindisi.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/07/kate-middleton1.jpg"><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-105" title="kate-middleton" src="http://www.albrindisi.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/07/kate-middleton1.jpg" alt="" width="334" height="222" /></a></p>
<p>With the impending royal wedding, Kate Middleton and Prince William have the topic of discussion all over the internet and the media. Every bride feels a kind of pressure on a tip-top condition as a wedding gift time comes, but when the wedding between a prince and a princess &#8211; and you can imagine the look on your best extra pressure.</p>
<p>So what exactly is Kate to do to stay in <strong>shape</strong>?  <a href="http://www.albrindisi.com/weight-loss/the-secret-of-kate-middleton%e2%80%99s-body-shape/#more-102" class="more-link">Read the rest of this entry &raquo;</a></p>
                  
    <!-- /article-content -->
</div>
<div class="cleared"></div>
<div class="art-postfootericons art-metadata-icons">
